+# OpenMP for the setup loops of the host of mfem-mgis (see
+# src/Batch/HostThreads.hxx), whatever the MFEM: its kernels run on the
+# GPU, or on one thread, while these loops use the processors given to the
+# process. Without the option, OpenMP is neither searched nor used by them
+set(MFEM_MGIS_HAVE_OPENMP OFF)
